{"id":"c89da0dadf4f3bf5","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-white-tree.md","title":"e-白树引理","display":"lem-white-tree — e-白树引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-white-tree","aliases":["20-lem-white-tree"],"display":"lem-white-tree — e-白树引理","chapter":"12","section":"12.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Lemma 12.2.3","source_pdf_pages":[230],"source_printed_pages":[200],"depends_on":["[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","[[20-df-e-splitting]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-white-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-white-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-white-tree — e-白树引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 12.2.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{EWhite}(T,e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\Phi_e^A\">\\(g=\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}white\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\nA\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}white\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\nA\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每层两个子节点的有限计算在某输入上有不同输出；询问 g 可确定 A 沿哪边，逐层恢复 A。域串和值串长度严格增长，得到全部位。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 12.2.3；印刷页 200；PDF 第 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","